---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | Karmatix Learning"
  description="Terms of Use for Karmatix Learning. Intellectual property, licensing, and usage conditions for our engineering courses."
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <article class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <!-- Notice Header -->
      <div class="mb-8 p-4 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-mono">
        NOTICE: Review with legal counsel before launch.
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#f8fafc] tracking-tight mb-4">
        Terms of Use
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#64748b] mb-8 font-mono">
        Last updated: November 7, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="prose prose-invert text-sm sm:text-base text-[#94a3b8] space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">1. Educational Platform Scope</h2>
          <p>
            Karmatix Learning is an open engineering resource published by Karmatix (karmatix.in). By accessing our courses, code repositories, and tools, you agree to these terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">2. Intellectual Property and Licensing</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
            <li><strong>Code Samples:</strong> Software code snippets, project architectures, and sample applications are provided under the permissive MIT License unless explicitly stated otherwise in the respective repository. You may use this code in personal or commercial software projects.</li>
            <li><strong>Curriculum Text and Visuals:</strong> All lesson prose, curriculum structure, diagrams, and written explanations are copyright &copy; Karmatix. All rights reserved. You may not republish, scrape, or resell the course materials without written consent.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">3. Trademark Disclaimers</h2>
          <p>
            .NET, C#, ASP.NET, Azure, and Visual Studio are trademarks of Microsoft Corporation. Flutter and Dart are trademarks of Google LLC. Karmatix Learning is an independent educational publisher and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Microsoft Corporation or Google LLC.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">4. Nature of Certificates</h2>
          <p>
            Certificates generated by our course platforms verify practical project completion against defined engineering rubrics. They do not represent accredited academic degrees, professional government licenses, or university credits.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p>
            All course materials, code samples, and configurations are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind. While we rigorously test our code in continuous integration pipelines, we cannot guarantee suitability for specific production deployments.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">6. Inquiries</h2>
          <p>
            For licensing inquiries or questions regarding these terms, please contact:
          </p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[#60a5fa] mt-2">
            contact@karmatix.in
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </article>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

